<view class="page {{theme}}"><view class="page-heading"><text class="eyebrow">YOUR WORDS</text><view class="title">生词本 <text class="small muted">{{count}} 个词</text></view><view class="subtitle">收藏和笔记保存在这台设备上。</view></view><input class="field" value="{{query}}" placeholder="搜索单词、释义或笔记" placeholder-class="muted" bindinput="onInput"/><view class="actions"><button bindtap="onExport">导出备份</button><button bindtap="onImport">导入 JSON</button></view><view class="card"><button wx:for="{{rows}}" wx:key="word" class="word-row" data-word="{{item.word}}" bindtap="onWord"><text class="word">{{item.word}}</text><text class="meaning">{{item.meaning}}</text><text wx:if="{{item.note}}" class="note-preview">笔记：{{item.note}}</text></button><view wx:if="{{!rows.length}}" class="empty">{{query ? '没有匹配的收藏，换个关键词试试。' : '还没有生词。查词后点击收藏，或保存自己的笔记。'}}</view></view><view class="footer">备份只在你主动导出、选择或分享文件时传递。此处没有账号同步。</view></view>
